
{"id":"12d6465d-73bb-4918-92ed-ae9d3e4facaa","object":"chat.completion","created":1785029664,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\"implementation\":\"def solve(case):\\n    items = case[\\\"items\\\"]\\n    required = case[\\\"required_failure_items\\\"]\\n    if not isinstance(items, list) or not isinstance(required, list):\\n        raise ValueError(\\\"Invalid input types\\\")\\n    for r in required:\\n        if r not in items:\\n            raise ValueError(f\\\"Required failure item {r} not in items\\\")\\n    items = list(items)\\n    required_set = set(required)\\n    attempts = 0\\n    granularity = 2\\n    while True:\\n        if granularity > len(items):\\n            granularity = 1\\n        n = len(items)\\n        removed = False\\n        for start in range(0, n, granularity):\\n            end = min(start + granularity, n)\\n            attempts += 1\\n            candidate = items[:start] + items[end:]\\n            if required_set.issubset(candidate):\\n                items = candidate\\n                removed = True\\n                break\\n        if removed:\\n            granularity += 1\\n        else:\\n            if granularity == 1:\\n                break\\n            granularity *= 2\\n    one_minimal = True\\n    for i in range(len(items)):\\n        candidate = items[:i] + items[i+1:]\\n        if required_set.issubset(candidate):\\n            one_minimal = False\\n            break\\n    return {\\n        \\\"attempts\\\": attempts,\\n        \\\"one_minimal\\\": one_minimal,\\n        \\\"reduced_items\\\": items\\n    }\"}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for SE-CR-02. The case payload has \"items\" (list of strings), \"required_failure_items\" (list of strings). We need to perform chunk reduction: start at granularity 2, try to remove chunks left to right, accept removal if required failure items remain (i.e., after removal, the set of required 